Package: com.icraze.swipeselection
Name: SwipeSelection
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
Conflicts: com.iky1e.swipeselection, com.iky1e.swipeselection-pro
Version: 2.6
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Swipe along the keyboard to move the cursor and select text. iOS 15+ RootHide build, ported from iCraze's maintained source (original author Kyle Howells). 2.6: fixed the "123" (More) key not switching to the numbers keyplane — the pan recognizer no longer delays/intercepts control-key touches.
